      "content": "The feeling that you don't belong is deeply distressing, and the silence you describe sounds isolating. Even when your connections feel lost, taking up space in the world is inherently valuable, even if you don't feel connected to it right now. Consider seeking out a new, smaller community, like a club or a low-pressure activity, to start rebuilding a sense of belonging piece by piece.",
