    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think i can do the \"piece by piece\" thing. it feels impossible. like trying to glue a shattered mirror back together, but the pieces are too small and the cracks are too deep. there's no version of my life where this doesn't follow me around. everyone knows. the damage is permanent. it's like i'm just waiting for the end of a movie that already finished, but i'm still stuck in the credits. how am i supposed to move on when everything i was is just gone?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
